Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thirty years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,an unprecedented disaster called\Na "spatial quake" assaulted our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Brought about unintentionally,\Nor perhaps done on purpose,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,the female life-forms which\Ncaused them were called "Spirits."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And their very existence was\Nkept secret from the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.87,0:01:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...I, Shido Itsuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.83,0:01:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go on and taste it, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.25,0:01:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No need to hold back! Eat, eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.09,0:01:17.55,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode One:\N'The Seventh Spirit'"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... This is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Foolish. It's stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We wanted to make some food\Nfor Shido, so we all put it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I appreciate the thought, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.27,0:01:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck's in here\Nto give it that color?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We went all out this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.48,0:01:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone tossed in the food they love best.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.61,0:01:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-Isn't that wonderful, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.99,0:01:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For them to make you something so yummy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.87,0:01:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Eat while it's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.67,0:01:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You contribute, too, Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Make an offering to complete this banquet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.47,0:02:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ooh! Kotori put in something, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.35,0:02:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's looking better and better!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.33,0:02:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How is it, Shido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Surprisingly good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.75,0:02:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--We did it!\N--I'm happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.84,0:02:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.34,0:02:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew Yuzuru's fried chicken\Nwould bring the taste together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.43,0:02:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Negative. It was Kaguya's pork cutlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what makes it so savory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! No, it was yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Insist. It was Kaguya's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You two never change...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:03:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's just call it a miracle collaboration\Nthat took everyone's help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They said on TV that stew is good\Nno matter what you put in, and it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Must be, for something\Nof this color to be edible...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a shame that Miku\Ncouldn't be here to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't be helped with her work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.21,0:03:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you call me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard all of your lonely calls!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.01,0:03:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So the Spirit idol, Miku Izayoi,\Nhas made her appearance at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.85,0:03:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Miku?!\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.73,0:03:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then you singing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A recording that looks like it's live!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyways, what are all of you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you having a party,\Nall together like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Speaking of which, I'm pretty\Nsure it's my birthday today!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All I want for a present\Nis a hot kiss from everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Wh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Defense. Kaguya Barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:04:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it, Miku! Get back in the TV at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Yuzuru!\N--Come on, don't be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--That's enough, Miku!\N--I need you for Kaguya Barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Let me go!\N--I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.93,0:04:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that's why you're all having stew!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyways, it's good to have you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.45,0:04:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's hot, so be extra careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my, what a peculiar color.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?! That's why I warned you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Darling... I seem to have\Nburned my poor lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unless you kiss them, they'll never heal...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you on about, Miku?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not how burns work!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.35,0:04:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, I have also burnt my lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Need urgent care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, no fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Shido. Don't forget Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I accidentally burnt my lips as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Big brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I did, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,White ribbon out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eek! Is everyone all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, I'll make you\Nall feel better right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Origami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I made stew, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's turtle, scorpion, and seal body parts...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.82,0:05:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...boiled in energy drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell me your thoughts\Nthe next time we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though ripe with trouble,\Nthe passing days were fulfilling...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's begin our date.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You all set, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Whenever you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How do I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So eerie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This park has been abandoned\Nsince the Great Spatial Quake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's far enough from redevelopment\Nthat it's still untouched to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then it's as it was 30 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Spirit moved from the spatial quake's\Norigin to that area somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:06:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Make contact before the AST shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.52,0:07:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--What the heck?!\N--What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.90,0:07:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This can't be what it was like...\NThere's just no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's faint, but we're detecting\Nspirit waves nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What you're seeing was\Nmanifested by a Spirit's powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You hearing that, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Spirit we're after is close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How rare a sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Usually when I get pulled here,\NI never meet anyone but the AST.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going to eat you or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:08:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? You're actually kinda cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.33,0:08:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't there alarms to take\Nshelter when a Spirit appears?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.00,0:08:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, our choices!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:14.26,OS,,0000,0000,0000,,"1. For one reason only. To meet you.\N2. I-I don't know. I escaped late and ended up here...\N 3. Since you're here, can I fondle your boobs?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Make your choice, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:18.26,OS,,0000,0000,0000,,"1. For one reason only. To meet you.\N2. I-I don't know. I escaped late and ended up here...\N 3. Since you're here, can I fondle your boobs?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, this one was straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's gotta be one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Without knowing her temperament,\Nit's best to act normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong! We should go with choice two!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.65,0:08:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This Spirit is a big sister type.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.69,0:08:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It might be surprising, but Shido\Ncan tickle maternal instincts!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.28,0:08:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm, mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.41,0:08:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That has some truth to it.\NThough, I'm shocked...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not a single person chose three?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Figured Kannazuki at least\Nwould pick that as a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.37,0:08:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Budding breasts are supreme!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Such floppy boobs like\Nthat don't interest me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.13,0:08:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If it was to lick the back of her knee,\NI'd have second thoughts, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:08:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Say it with puppy eyes as best as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.89,0:09:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.31,0:09:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I escaped late and ended up here...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.49,0:09:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.66,0:09:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Such a cute name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.37,0:09:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though I guess some of you\Nfolks are calling me Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ms. Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds so stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.43,0:09:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Big Sis here wants to ask\Nyou a little something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.26,0:09:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.64,0:09:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you... think that I'm pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think you're very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.11,0:09:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it! What specifically?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:10:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, what part of Big Sis\Ndo you think is pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your almond eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How your nose is so straight...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your feminine style...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What else? What else?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And... your hair... is so silky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, you're right on the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.84,0:10:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.93,0:10:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This me... is pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the AST!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.98,0:10:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get to work, Haniel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.06,0:11:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's escape while we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll give Big Sis a lot\Nmore compliments, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.37,0:11:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind doing that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.55,0:11:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The surveillance camera is inoperable!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.68,0:11:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll restore it briefly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't see that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You okay, Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.56,0:11:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, it's an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.61,0:12:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi's happiness meter is plummeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You saw, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You saw my...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unforgivable...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You won't get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your life... It's about to be over for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.22,0:12:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did she just vanish like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.03,0:12:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's already lunch break?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:13:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those strategy meetings for dealing\Nwith Natsumi went all night...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.18,0:13:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you show your face, Shido Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you know what you've done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.81,0:13:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What gives? What is this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.15,0:13:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have some nerve to play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.23,0:13:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Making lewd passes at innocent Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Embarrassing the hell out of Mai and Mii!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And not just that! Even Tohka was\Na victim of your heinous crimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's so lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.54,0:13:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was busy with stuff\Nand just got to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.21,0:13:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should know when to fess up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido... What's done is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you shouldn't pretend it didn't happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,N-Next time, give me a heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.43,0:13:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That way, I can prepare my heart first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm telling you I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me I did something to you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.27,0:13:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What do you think you're\Ndoing, Origami Tobiichi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you just said I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I'll have you do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes... Do everything you did to me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Push me against the wall...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lift up my chin...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.05,0:14:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whisper sweet words into my ear...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.55,0:14:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gently peeling up my skirt...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.47,0:14:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We exchange a deep, romantic kiss...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You pull off my clothes,\Nsteal my innocence as a woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.85,0:14:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And leave your everlasting mark...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...imbued within my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait up! He hasn't done\Nthat to anybody yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.11,0:14:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do it, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.82,0:14:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now listen here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There you are, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If there's one thing you are,\Nit's ballsy to stick around!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Warning. You'll pay for what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:15:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaguya! Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me you think I\Ndid something to you, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Feigning ignorance?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.55,0:15:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You better give back the\Npanties you stole from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.05,0:15:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.17,0:15:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who else threw water on me saying\N"I have a wet shirt fetish"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! I would never do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.97,0:15:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To think he has no bounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.18,0:15:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This goes way beyond horsing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.19,0:15:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, we won't stand for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.73,0:15:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a crime to defy us Yamai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.19,0:15:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you'll have to pay for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,More specifically, I'll \Nstrip off your undies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Response.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.74,0:15:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Additionally, I shall use this\Nspray bottle to soak your entire body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No... I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't become a bride anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have to take responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even Ms. Tammie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.09,0:15:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.51,0:15:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,About earlier... Were you actually serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.68,0:15:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I... dunno what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.76,0:15:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You... gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:15:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let 'em live!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's so lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.69,0:16:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What in the world is happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who... are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was having all sorts of fun\Nwhile you were away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You... What are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.73,0:16:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you after by impersonating me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.56,0:16:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.98,0:16:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dumb Shido still hasn't realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That voice... Natsumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:17:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ding ding! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.45,0:17:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Surely you know why I've\Nimpersonated you by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your life... It's about to be over for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.09,0:17:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you do all those crazy things\Nso I couldn't live here anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pitiful. Twenty points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.85,0:17:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.31,0:17:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think it's strange\Nto have two of the same person?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unless there's just one of us,\Neveryone will be so confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.61,0:17:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.57,0:17:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,From now on, I'll take over as Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have quite the observant eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't goof around like I did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you're gone,\Nno one will suspect a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oof! You go look somewhere else!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:18:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be the one to find Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my line!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't leave him up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.18,0:18:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's two Shidos?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.27,0:18:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka, Origami! Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.69,0:18:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--This guy--\N--This guy is an imposter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.78,0:18:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's the fake who's been\Nharassing everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be fooled! I'm the real one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're full of it! I'm the real one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.41,0:18:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, we have\Nto pick out the imposter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A baffling situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, if I had to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the imposter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about, you two?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the real--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You are not Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, you look like Shido,\Nbut he has a different smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you were all alone,\NI may have been deceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.19,0:18:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, standing next to the\Nreal Shido, it's a different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.90,0:18:52.15,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Shido A"\N"Shido B"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Compared to the real Shido,\Nyou blink 50 milliseconds faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:19:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And your center of gravity\Nis angled 0.2 degrees left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no mistaking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with these girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I can't deny it...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.33,0:19:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unbelievable! Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.25,0:19:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.47,0:19:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.30,0:19:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not only was my secret seen...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.26,0:19:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My flawless disguise was\Nseen right through!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Never! I'll never acknowledge it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not off the hook just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.53,0:19:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who in the world was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.95,0:19:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's your relationship with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.05,0:20:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been five days...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No movement from Natsumi either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's she planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.89,0:20:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? That wasn't the sofa. It's Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you a bit too relaxed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever the reason,\NNatsumi views you as her enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll never be able to seal her power\Nunless you raise her happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.74,0:20:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I know that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no knowing when\Nshe'll next appear, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:34.88,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Shido Itsuka"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look. This showed up in the post.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:35.75,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Natsumi"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:39.63,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Shido Itsuka"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.75,0:20:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I never opened it, but I\Nchecked it was safe at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:41.76,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Natsumi"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So it shouldn't go "boom"\Nor anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.31,0:20:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A photo of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:20:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Twelve of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.61,0:20:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.23,0:21:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Among them, I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.81,0:21:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you guess who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.91,0:21:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before everyone is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Natsumi."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.28,0:21:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we take the message at face value...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Among these 12 people here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi is already using her\Npowers to impersonate someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.01,0:21:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's also possible that it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.01,0:21:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido. This is a challenge from Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.55,0:21:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unless you guess which person she is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I imagine somebody will disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.73,0:21:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Find her, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before we're all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Date.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.17,0:22:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So sweet, agonizing, and beloved...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.55,0:22:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The curtains are raised.\NNow, for the third time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.85,0:22:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.26,0:23:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Two:\N'Can You Find Me?'"
